l_error_on_malformed_manifest() {"," ","     let err = WorkspaceSettings::find_and_load(tmp.path())","         .expect_err(\"malformed yaml must surface as ParseYaml\");","+    assert_eq!(","+        miette::Diagnostic::code(&err).map(|code| code.to_string()).as_deref(),","+        Some(\"ERR_PNPM_INVALID_SETTING\"),","+    );","     let LoadWorkspaceYamlError::ParseYaml { path, .. } = err else {","         panic!(\"expected ParseYaml, got {err:?}\");","     };"],"additions":4,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/docs/settings/network.md","lines":["@@ -60,6 +60,8 @@ Empty, `false`, and `null` values behave as described for [`httpsProxy`](#httpsp"," The IP address of the local interface to use when making connections to the npm"," registry."," ","+Pass `--local-address <ip>` on the command line to set this value.","+"," ### maxsockets"," "," * Default: **unset**","@@ -82,6 +84,8 @@ command line wins even when the two sides spelled the setting differently."," Whether or not to do SSL key validation when making requests to the registry via"," HTTPS."," ","+Use `--strict-ssl` to enable validation or `--no-strict-ssl` to disable it.","+"," ### userAgent"," "," * Default: `pnpm/<version> npm/? node/? <platform> <arch>`",""],"additions":4,"deletions":0,"truncated":false}],"additions":42,"deletions":1,"truncated":false,"file_count":6},"error":null,"fetched_at":"2026-10-30T15:55:35.312254+00:00"}